          "capabilities": [
            "records.read",
            "formal.generate",
            "candidates.propose"
          ],
          "principles": [
            "必需精确 formalization-packet；包由先前 utility.assemble-packet 组装，本操作不创建或改写包。",
            "代码和诊断保留原目标、假设、声明与环境；变化请求必须产生新包和新尝试。",
            "formalization-attempt 的 work-attempt 由 host 根据真实运行装配，不伪造历史或执行归属。",
            "生成者不输出独立 formal-check、对齐或认证；DELIVERED 不表示 Lean 成功或科学成立。"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "agent_id": "review",
      "title": "Review：按职责和身份隔离的审阅",
      "execution_kind": "MODEL",
      "operations": [
        {
          "operation": "review.scope",
          "input_record_types": [
            "inventory-discovery",
            "source-snapshot",
